# The battery level on the recovery screen: the power supplies sit under their I2C buses,
# whose whole subtree is labelled sysfs_batteryinfo (genfs_contexts); the platform policy
# only gives recovery the files. Without this the log fills with denials (dozens a second).
allow recovery sysfs_batteryinfo:dir r_dir_perms;
allow recovery sysfs_batteryinfo:lnk_file read;
